      "name": "GetRotationLookupValue",
      "signature": "dword GetRotationLookupValue(dword dwLevelOfRotation, dword dwRotationBits)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Validate and retrieve rotation offset from lookup table.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate nLevelOfRotation < 0x40 - error 0x179 if invalid\n2. Get rotation bitcount via FUN_6fe20aa0(dwRotationBits)\n3. Validate bitcount < 8 - error 0x17a if invalid  \n4. Verify bitcount using Wegner's algorithm with masks 0x77777777, 0x33333333, 0x11111111\n5. Check formula result: ((accumulated & 0xf0f0f0f) % 0xff) == 1 - error 0x17b if invalid\n6. Get final bitcount = FUN_6fe20aa0(dwRotationBits)\n7. Calculate offset = (bitcount * 0x40 + nLevelOfRotation) * 4\n8. Return g_aRotationLookupTable[offset]\n\nParameters:\nuint dwLevelOfRotation - Rotation level (0-63), validated < 0x40\nuint dwRotationBits - Rotation bit pattern, passes bitcount validation\n\nReturns:\nuint - Rotation lookup value, or never returns if validation fails",
