      "name": "CreateCelDrawData",
      "signature": "dword CreateCelDrawData(dword dwCelId, CelDrawDataInfo * * ppDrawData)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Creates a CelDrawDataInfo record from a CelFileInfo entry looked up by Cel ID.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Enter critical section g_CelCriticalSection for thread-safe access\n2. Compute hash bucket index: dwBucketIndex = dwCelId AND g_dwCelTableMask\n3. Calculate hash entry address: g_pCelDataTable + (dwBucketIndex * 12) + 4\n4. Search linked list for entry matching dwCelId\n5. If no match found, call GetOffsetPointer to traverse to next node\n6. Continue until match found or list exhausted\n7. If entry not found, leave critical section and set nCriticalSectionHeld = 0\n8. Initialize output *ppDrawData = NULL\n9. Validate entry has data size (offset +0x24 != 0), else return 0x85200001\n10. Verify data size divisible by element stride (offset +0x28), else return 0x85200002\n11. Allocate CelDrawDataInfo via AllocClientMemory: size = (dataSize * 4) + 0x18\n12. Initialize record header: type = 6\n13. Copy flags from CelFileInfo+0x18 to record+0x4\n14. Copy format from CelFileInfo+0x1C to record+0x8\n15. Copy element stride from CelFileInfo+0x28 to record+0x10\n16. Calculate element count = dataSize / stride, store at record+0x14\n17. If flags & 0x4 set, call ProcessListNodeBuffer to populate data\n18. Otherwise dispatch via g_pCelDispatchTable[format] to decode\n19. Leave critical section if held, store result in *ppDrawData\n20. Return 0 on success\n\nParameters:\n- dwCelId: Unique identifier for the Cel file entry to look up\n- ppDrawData: Output pointer to receive allocated CelDrawDataInfo\n\nReturns:\n- 0x00000000: Success, *ppDrawData contains valid CelDrawDataInfo pointer\n- 0x85200001: Entry found but has no data (dataSize == 0)\n- 0x85200002: Data size not aligned to element stride\n\nStructure Layout - CelFileInfo (accessed):\nOffset  Size  Field           Description\n+0x00   4     dwCelId         Cel identifier for hash matching\n+0x18   4     dwFlags         Processing flags (bit 2 = use ProcessListNodeBuffer)\n+0x1C   4     dwFormat        Dispatch table index for decoder\n+0x20   4     dwExtra         Extra data copied to record+0xC\n+0x24   4     dwDataSize      Total data size in bytes\n+0x28   4     dwElementStride Element size for array calculation\n\nStructure Layout - CelDrawDataInfo (created):\nOffset  Size  Field           Description\n+0x00   4     dwType          Record type identifier (always 6)\n+0x04   4     dwFlags         Flags copied from CelFileInfo+0x18\n+0x08   4     dwFormat        Format copied from CelFileInfo+0x1C\n+0x0C   4     dwExtra         Extra field set by processor\n+0x10   4     dwElementStride Stride copied from CelFileInfo+0x28\n+0x14   4     dwElementCount  Calculated: dwDataSize / dwElementStride\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x85200001 - CEL_ERROR_NO_DATA: Entry has zero data size\n0x85200002 - CEL_ERROR_STRIDE_MISMATCH: Data size not divisible by stride\n0x6 - Record type identifier for CelDrawDataInfo\n0x4 - Flag bit for ProcessListNodeBuffer processing path\n0x255 - Allocation type parameter for AllocClientMemory\n\nRelated Functions:\n- GetOffsetPointer() - Traverses linked list to find next node\n- ProcessListNodeBuffer() - Processes node buffer when flags & 0x4 set\n- AllocClientMemory() - Memory allocation for record creation (Fog.dll)",
