      "comment": "Validates data pointer and processes conditional flags.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if pData is NULL\n2. If NULL, call FogAssertFail with error code 0x404 and terminate\n3. Load flag value from pData[1] (offset 0x4)\n4. Test if flags & 0x03 != 0 (lower 2 bits set)\n5. If yes and flags & 0x02 != 0, call Ordinal_10032 to process data\n6. Call Ordinal_10043 with code 0x40b to update skill data table\n7. Return\n\nParameters:\n- pData (int*): Pointer to data structure with flags at offset +4\n\nReturns:\n- void: No return value on success; terminates on NULL input\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x404: Error severity code for FogAssertFail\n- 0x40b: Skill data update code passed to Ordinal_10043\n- 0x03: Flag test mask (bits 0-1)\n- 0x02: Conditional processing bit (bit 1)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "API",
      "index": "API:831e0d62219c21b79b3b2ad58bbf8a8b",
