      "name": "SetCelfileCallback",
      "signature": "void SetCelfileCallback(void * pfnCallback)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Sets the global CEL file callback function pointer.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load callback function pointer from stack parameter [ESP+0x4]\n2. Store pointer in global g_pfnCelfileCallback\n3. Return to caller via RET 0x4 (stdcall cleanup)\n\nParameters:\n- pfnCallback (void*): Function pointer to CEL file processing callback\n\nReturns:\n- void: No return value\n\nNotes:\n- Global g_pfnCelfileCallback is used by ProcessCelfile to process CEL files\n- GetCelfileCallback retrieves the current callback pointer\n- Callback is invoked for each CEL file element during rendering",
