      "name": "DestructAuctionStorage",
      "signature": "void DestructAuctionStorage(void * pAuctionStorage)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Destructor for AuctionStorage object - cleans up nested hash tables and lists\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Install exception handling frame\n2. Set virtual method pointer to first destructor stage (ProcessAuctionSlot @6fe2c90c)\n3. Loop through first hash table (field +0x40): decrement ref count with Ordinal_403\n4. Call destructor on items in second collection (field +0x30): call DestructorWithConditionalCleanup\n5. Set state byte to 0x01, process third container (field +0x3c): reverse iteration cleanup\n6. Call FUN_6fe13b10 to extract and relocate container nodes, clear pointers\n7. Process fourth container (field +0x2c): similar cleanup pattern\n8. Set virtual method pointer to second stage destructor (ProcessAuctionSlot @6fe2c8fc)\n9. Initialize nested container at field +0x04 with FUN_6fe13870\n10. Iterate through array (field +0x18) of nested structures (size 0x0c each), field +0x08 = item count\n11. Call FUN_6fe13850 on each nested container and cleanup with FUN_6fe136a0\n12. Destroy hash table at field +0x14 with DestroyHashTableNodes\n13. Finalize nested container cleanup, restore exception list pointer\n\nParameters:\npAuctionStorage (ECX): void * - Pointer to AuctionStorage structure (specific type unknown)\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Exception list restored before return\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Uses two-stage destruction with vtable pointer changes at 0x6fe2c90c and 0x6fe2c8fc\n- Exception handling wraps entire cleanup (registers ExceptionList handler at +0x08)\n- Field +0x40 and +0x30 use hash table iteration with Ordinal_403 (SMemFree) calls\n- Nested structures at field +0x18 require per-item cleanup in loop\n- Note: Function uses 1 stack-allocated temporary (local_10) optimized away\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x40 - Field +0x40 = first hash table count\n0x30 - Field +0x30 = second destruction collection\n0x3c - Field +0x3c = third container (offset +0x04 = count)\n0x2c - Field +0x2c = fourth container\n0x04 - Nested container to initialize / Container size field offset\n0x18 - Array of nested structures\n0x0c - Size of each nested structure element\n0x08 - Item count field within nested structure\n0x14 - Hash table to destroy\n0x6fe2c90c - First stage vtable pointer (ProcessAuctionSlot)\n0x6fe2c8fc - Second stage vtable pointer (ProcessAuctionSlot)",
