      "name": "CopyBytesWithTableTransform",
      "signature": "void CopyBytesWithTableTransform(byte * pbSrcData, int nDestOffset, int nRows, int nRowSize, int nHeight, int nLeftEdge, int nRightEdge, int nTableBase)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Copies rows of bytes using table-based lookup transformation with clipping.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize row height tracking from stack parameter\n2. For each of N input rows:\n3.   Read bytes sequentially from source; if high bit (0x80) SET, extract count in low 7 bits\n4.   Calculate left edge clipping: max(0, -nRowHeightStart + nLeftEdge)\n5.   Calculate right edge clipping: min(char_count, -nRowHeightStart + nRightEdge)\n6.   If clipped range empty (right <= left), skip entire character block\n7.   Otherwise, for each byte in valid range, lookup value via table at (byte_value + nTableBase)\n8.   Write transformed byte to destination with 8-byte unrolling for performance\n9.   When byte has high bit CLEAR (0x80 = 0), terminate current row and move to next\n10. Repeat until all N rows processed or final row terminator encountered\n\nParameters:\n  pbSrcData (ECX) - Pointer to source byte stream\n  nDestOffset (EDX) - Base destination offset (typically 0)\n  nRows (stack 0x4) - Number of rows to copy\n  nRowSize (stack 0x8) - Width of each row in pixels\n  nHeight (stack 0xc) - Starting height offset for clipping\n  nLeftEdge (stack 0x10) - Left edge clipping boundary\n  nRightEdge (stack 0x14) - Right edge clipping boundary  \n  nTableBase (stack 0x18) - Base address for byte value lookup table\n\nReturns:\n  void - No return value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Byte with bit 0x80 SET: Extract run count from lower 7 bits, advance height counter\n  - Byte with bit 0x80 CLEAR (value 0): Row terminator, return if final row\n  - Negative left/right bounds clamp to 0\n  - Right bound clamped to character width to prevent buffer overflow\n  - 8-byte copy unrolling optimizes throughput",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:f8c7a81d81eaaab45678bd489418aacb",
