      "signature": "void SetGameStateFlag(dword dwValue)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Sets the global game state flag used for game status checks.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load parameter value into EAX\n2. Store EAX value at global address g_dwGameStateFlag\n3. Return to caller\n\nParameters:\ndwValue (dword): New game state flag value\n\nReturns:\nNone (void function, returns via RET 0x4)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Global g_dwGameStateFlag is checked by Ordinal_10007 during gameplay\n\nRelated Functions:\n- Ordinal_10007 - Reads g_dwGameStateFlag for conditional logic",
