      "name": "InitializeGlobalPalettes",
      "signature": "void InitializeGlobalPalettes(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Initializes six global palette buffers from configuration files.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. For each palette configuration (white, grey, brown variants):\n   a. Build path string: base path + subpath + extension\n   b. Call InitializeResourceAndLock to open palette file\n   c. On success: ReadAndValidateFileData loads 0x1500 bytes to palette buffer\n   d. On failure: Zero-fill buffer (0x540 dwords = 5376 bytes)\n2. Call BuildAndApplyPaletteShift for invgrey2 (id=7) and invgreybrown (id=8)\n\nParameters:\n(void) - No parameters\n\nReturns:\n(void) - No return value\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0xFFFFFFFF: SCASB string length counter init\n- 0x540: Palette buffer size in dwords (5376 bytes)\n- 0x1500: Palette data size in bytes (5376)\n- 0x38: Error path copy size (56 bytes)\n- 7, 8: Palette shift resource IDs (invgrey2, invgreybrown)\n\nGlobal Data:\n| Address | Buffer |\n|---------|--------|\n| 0x6febd3c0 | g_abPaletteBuffer1 |\n| 0x6fec3cc0 | g_abPaletteBuffer2 |\n| 0x6feca5c0 | g_abPaletteBuffer3 |\n| 0x6fed0ec0 | g_abPaletteBuffer4 |\n| 0x6fed77c0 | g_abPaletteBuffer5 |\n| 0x6fede0c0 | g_abPaletteBuffer6 |",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
