      "name": "InitializeSpriteFrameData",
      "signature": "dword InitializeSpriteFrameData(int * pCelContext, byte * pCelData, int nFrames, int nDirections)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "comment": "Initialize sprite frame data with frame offsets and async decompression handlers.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Allocate GfxNode structure (184 bytes) from heap\n2. Clear all 46 dword fields in GfxNode to zero\n3. Copy frame info from CelContext: frame IDs (field 3,4,5,6,7)\n4. Determine frame offset range based on CelData type (type 1,2,3,4,6)\n5. Calculate start and end frame offsets from CelData offset table\n6. Populate GfxBlock direction offsets array (nOffsets[32])\n7. Register async decompression handler with Storm DLL for sprite data\n8. Create palette cache hash entry linking to CelContext and GfxNode\n9. For INDEXED type, call frame context initialization to populate CEL handles\n10. Return 1 if successful, 0 if already initialized\n\nParameters:\npCelContext (int *) - CelContext structure containing frame metadata and palette info\npCelData (byte *) - CelData structure with frame offset table and compressed sprite data\nnFrames (int) - Number of frames to initialize (usually 1)\nnDirections (int) - Number of directions per frame (1-8)\n\nReturns:\n1 - Successfully initialized sprite frame data\n0 - Frame data already initialized or not INDEXED type\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x02 - FLAG: Cell uses alpha/transparency (param_2[1] & 0x02)\n0x04 - FLAG: GfxBlock has decompression pending (GfxNode field offset 0x2c)\n0x01 - FLAG: Cell is INDEXED format requiring CEL decompression (param_2[0] & 0x01)\n0x6ff02bc0 - Global sprite frame heap handle (Storm subsystem)\n0xb8 - GfxNode structure size (184 bytes)\n0x2e - Loop iterations to clear 46 dwords (184 bytes / 4)\n\nImplicit Parameters:\nECX - param_1 (pCelContext) passed in ECX (fastcall)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- CreateUnitFilePath() - Generate sprite file path for verification\n- AllocateAndLinkResourceNode() - Create palette cache entry\n- FUN_6fe1d060() - Initialize CEL frame context (INDEXED only)\n- FUN_6fe1d710() - Link CEL handles to Cel structure\n- Ordinal_10018() - Storm DLL: LimitedSync function for offset calculation\n- Ordinal_10091() - Storm DLL: RegisterAsyncBlock for sprite decompression\n- Ordinal_10095() - Storm DLL: SetAsyncBlockSize to finalize registration\n- FUN_6fe1e020() - Memory allocator from heap\n- FogAssertFail() - Fatal assertion handler\n- FUN_6fe21293() - Termination function",
