      "name": "CountPendingAsyncOperations",
      "signature": "int CountPendingAsyncOperations(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Count the number of pending asynchronous sprite cache operations.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize pending count to 0\n2. Load head of global async data linked list (g_pAsyncDataList)\n3. If list is NULL, return 0 immediately\n4. For each node in the linked list:\n   a. Dereference node to get async item pointer\n   b. If item pointer is NULL, skip to next node\n   c. Check status flags at item+0x20; if bit 0 is set (completed), skip\n   d. Get async operation handle at item+0xB0\n   e. If handle is NULL, assert failure and terminate\n   f. Call PollAsyncOperationStatus to check if operation is still pending\n   g. If poll returns 0 (still pending), increment pending count\n   h. Advance to next node via link at offset 0x14\n5. Return total count of pending operations\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\nint - Number of async operations still pending (not yet completed)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Returns 0 if async data list is empty\n- Asserts and terminates if async item exists but has NULL operation handle\n- Skips items with completion flag (bit 0 at offset 0x20) already set\n\nStructure Layout (AsyncDataNode):\nOffset  Size  Field              Description\n0x00    4     pAsyncItem         Pointer to async item data\n0x14    4     pNext              Next node in linked list\n\nStructure Layout (AsyncItem):\nOffset  Size  Field              Description\n0x20    1     bStatusFlags       Status flags (bit 0 = completed)\n0xB0    4     pAsyncOpHandle     Handle to async operation\n\nSource File: SpriteCache.cpp line 0xA3F (2623)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "API",
      "index": "API:403127533ac2523dedf20ab85f6f0449",
