      "name": "UpdateTileListPaletteIndices",
      "signature": "void UpdateTileListPaletteIndices(TileProject * pTileList)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Updates palette indices for all tiles and components in a TileProject list.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate pTileList not null (assert \"ptList\")\n2. Iterate through tiles at offset 0xC (linked via offset 0x5C)\n3. For each tile, iterate through components at offset 0x58 (linked via 0x10)\n4. Update palette index 0x34 if component has data at offset 0xC\n5. Update palette index 0x37 for each component\n6. Update palette index 0x5F for each tile\n7. Update palette index 0x8B on completion\n\nParameters:\n- pTileList (TileProject*): Pointer to TileProject containing tile hierarchy\n\nReturns:\n- void (terminates via TerminateProcessWithCode on null assertions)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x0C: TileProject.pFirstTile / Component.pData offset\n- 0x58: Tile.pFirstComponent offset\n- 0x5C: Tile.pNextTile offset\n- 0x10: Component.pNextComponent offset\n- 0x34 (52): Component data palette type\n- 0x37 (55): Component palette type\n- 0x5F (95): Tile palette type\n- 0x8B (139): List completion palette type",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "API",
      "index": "API:f13a12e1c1c13252dc690c1069762c21",
