      "name": "GetTileHeight",
      "signature": "ushort GetTileHeight(TileData * pTileData)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Retrieve tile height from TileData structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if pTileData pointer is NULL\n2. If NULL, call Ordinal_10025 (Fog.ErrorMsg) to report error\n3. Extract 16-bit height value from offset +6 in TileData structure\n4. Return height value in AX register (zero-extended)\n\nParameters:\n- pTileData (TileData*): Pointer to tile data structure containing height field\n\nReturns:\n- ushort: Tile height value from TileData.wHeight (offset +6)\n- Returns undefined value if pTileData is NULL (error path does not return early)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x6: Offset of wHeight field in TileData structure\n- 0x7a (122): Line number passed to error handler",
