      "signature": "int GetTileOffset(int nFlag)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Calculate tile offset with conditional initialization.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Test if nFlag is zero\n2. If zero, call InitTileResource with tile handle, source path, and 0x80 flag\n3. Return input + 0x28 (40-byte offset adjustment)\n\nParameters:\n- nFlag (int): Status flag; if 0, triggers tile resource initialization\n\nReturns:\n- int: Input value adjusted by 0x28 bytes (40-byte offset)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If nFlag != 0, no initialization occurs\n- Return value always applied regardless of flag state\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x28 (40): Tile offset adjustment, likely structure field size\n- 0x80 (128): Flag for InitTileResource, possibly read-only mode",
