      "name": "GetTextHeightForStringId",
      "signature": "int GetTextHeightForStringId(uint dwStringStruct)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Retrieves text height from a string structure, optionally initializing it.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if dwStringStruct is NULL (zero)\n2. If NULL, call GetTextHeight (Ordinal_10025) to initialize with default tile handle and path\n3. Dereference offset 0x10 from the structure base to get height value\n4. Return the height as a 32-bit integer\n\nParameters:\n- dwStringStruct (uint): Base address of string structure containing text metrics\n\nReturns:\n- int: Text height in pixels stored at structure offset 0x10\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x10 (16): Offset to height field within string structure\n- 0x81 (129): Character code parameter for initialization call",
