      "name": "ComputedJumpThunk",
      "signature": "void ComputedJumpThunk(void * pData, void * pfnTarget)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "comment": "Indirect call thunk that performs a computed jump\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Pop EAX - retrieve saved return address from stack setup\n2. Pop ECX - retrieve implicit second parameter (target function pointer)\n3. Exchange EAX with [ESP] - restore return address on stack for eventual return\n4. Jump to EAX - perform computed indirect jump to target function\n\nParameters:\npData (void*) - First parameter/data context passed implicitly via stack\npfnTarget (void*) - Function pointer target for indirect jump (passed via ECX register as IMPLICIT parameter)\n\nReturns:\nvoid - Indirect jump does not return to caller; control transfers to target function\n\nSpecial Cases:\nStack manipulation required for indirect calls; assumes valid non-null function pointer",
