      "name": "CopyData3Dwords",
      "signature": "void CopyData3Dwords(dword * pdwDst, dword * pdwSrc)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Copy 3 dwords (12 bytes) from source buffer to destination buffer with offset calculation.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Calculate offset delta: nOffsetDelta = pdwDst - pdwSrc\n2. Initialize loop counter: nCount = 3\n3. Loop 3 times:\n   - Load dword from pdwSrc at current offset\n   - Store dword to (nOffsetDelta + pdwSrc)\n   - Advance pdwSrc pointer by 1 dword (4 bytes)\n   - Decrement nCount\n4. Return after loop completes\n\nParameters:\n  pdwDst (dword *): Destination buffer address for copy\n  pdwSrc (dword *): Source buffer starting address\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Uses register-based offset calculation (ECX) for efficiency\n  - Exactly 3 dwords copied, no validation of buffer sizes\n  - If pdwSrc equals pdwDst, copies to same location (nOffsetDelta = 0)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:15ec667135b11a0873a61b429d37dd78",
