      "name": "AcquireOrEnterCriticalSection",
      "signature": "void AcquireOrEnterCriticalSection(int nSectionIndex, int nOwnerObj)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Acquire or enter critical section based on index threshold.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load section index from parameter nSectionIndex\n2. Compare index against fixed threshold value 0x14\n3. If index < 0x14: Initialize critical section at (nSectionIndex + 0x1c)\n4. If index >= 0x14: Enter critical section at (nOwnerObj + 0x20)\n5. Return to caller\n\nParameters:\nnSectionIndex (int): Section index value, determines which critical section path to use\nnOwnerObj (int): Owner object base address for critical section structure access\n\nReturns:\nvoid: Function returns no value after acquiring/entering critical section\n\nSpecial Cases:\nThreshold value 0x14 (20 decimal) separates two critical section handling methods\nOffsets 0x1c and 0x20 point to critical section structures within larger objects",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:2221715ad392d22929a667a9021e3f90",
