      "name": "QueryCodePage",
      "signature": "dword QueryCodePage(int nCodePageId)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Query system code page based on request type.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load nCodePageId from stack into EAX\n2. Clear g_dwCodePageQueryStatus flag (AND with 0)\n3. Compare nCodePageId with -2:\n   - If equal: Set status flag to 1, call GetOEMCP() and return result\n4. Compare nCodePageId with -3:\n   - If equal: Set status flag to 1, call GetACP() and return result\n5. Compare nCodePageId with -4:\n   - If equal: Load g_dwCodePage, set status flag to 1, return it\n6. Otherwise: Clear status flag to 0, return nCodePageId unchanged\n\nParameters:\nnCodePageId (int): Code page request type\n  -2: Query OEM code page\n  -3: Query ANSI code page\n  -4: Query current configured code page\n  Other: Return as-is\n\nReturns:\ndword: Requested code page identifier\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Status flag (g_dwCodePageQueryStatus) set to 1 when query succeeds, 0 for unknown values\n- OEM/ACP queries return system values via Win32 API\n- Default code page query returns g_dwCodePage global\n- Note: Function uses stack-allocated temporaries optimized away by compiler",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
