      "name": "ConvertCharacterWithCriticalSection",
      "signature": "dword ConvertCharacterWithCriticalSection(dword dwChar)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "comment": "Converts character or performs lookup with optional critical section protection\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if g_bTableEnabled is zero\n   - If disabled: Check if dwChar is in range 0x61-0x7a (lowercase 'a'-'z')\n     - If yes: Return dwChar - 0x20 (convert to uppercase by subtracting space character)\n     - If no: Return unchanged dwChar (passthrough)\n   - If enabled: Continue with table lookup\n2. Increment global reference count atomically\n3. Check if critical section is in use (g_bCriticalSectionInUse)\n4. If critical section needed:\n   - Decrement reference count\n   - Acquire/initialize critical section at index 0x13\n5. Call FUN_6fe288c8 with critical section context and dwChar\n6. If critical section was in use:\n   - Release critical section at index 0x13\n   Else:\n   - Decrement reference count\n7. Return result from FUN_6fe288c8 or converted character\n\nParameters:\n   dwChar (dword): Character code to convert or lookup, checked against 0x61-0x7a range\n\nReturns:\n   dword: Converted character (dwChar - 0x20 for lowercase a-z when table disabled), or lookup result from table\n\nSpecial Cases:\n   - When g_bTableEnabled is zero: Function acts as simple lowercase-to-uppercase converter for a-z\n   - When g_bTableEnabled is non-zero: Function delegates to FUN_6fe288c8 with critical section protection\n   - Critical section index 0x13: Reserved for character conversion operations\n   - Magic number 0x20: ASCII offset between uppercase and lowercase letters\n   - Magic number 0x61 (97): ASCII code for 'a'\n   - Magic number 0x7a (122): ASCII code for 'z'\n   - Magic number 0x13 (19): Critical section index identifier\n\nRelated Functions:\n   - FUN_6fe288c8: Performs table-based character conversion\n   - AcquireOrInitializeCriticalSection: Acquires critical section lock\n   - LeaveCriticalSectionIndex: Releases critical section lock\n   - InterlockedIncrement/InterlockedDecrement: Thread-safe reference counting",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
